  introTitle: The Story So Far
  introText: 'All the coins in the town fountain have been stolen! They were supposed
    to go to a charity!


    Luckily, you''ve investigated the fountain and found
    a clue: some chocolate fingerprints and a candy wrapper from the general store.


    See
    if you can find out where it came from and look for more clues!'
  endTitle: Demo Complete
  endText: This concludes our demo! What will you discover in the Library next?
  onIntroClosed:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  onDemoEnd:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
